  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Federasi Futsal Indonesia (FFI) is currently experiencing leadership disputes following the removal of Michael Sianipar as chairman. Amid these internal developments, the PSSI has formalised the creation of an Election Committee and an Election Appeals Committee to oversee the upcoming Extraordinary Congress. While the election committee has refuted claims regarding the illegality of the process, Sianipar maintains that the move is unlawful and has challenged the PSSI to provide evidence justifying his dismissal. Sianipar has confirmed he is prepared to participate in ethics committee hearings and has expressed support for a thorough financial investigation into the organization’s use of state-allocated and private funding. Meanwhile, reports indicate that communication with PSSI leadership remains ongoing, although the football association has not yet provided a formal response to the former chairman's inquiries.",
